/-! ## §4 — Gate-1 arithmetic at `c = 93/8` -/

/-- **Gate-1 arithmetic at `c = 93/8` under the hybrid scheme.**

States the COMPUTED gate value `0.97972797`, not the fixed `3/4` of the
old `Mc_lb = 1/8` shape. That fixed target is false from `c = 29/4` on (here the
margin against it is `-0.22972797`), while the parameterised criterion
`L0(c−r)·r < Mc_lb` holds far beyond it — so the bound must be the real one. -/
theorem gate1_arithmetic_hybrid {epsOm : ℝ} (hEps : epsOm ≤ 1 / 10 ^ 21) :
    (8649/64 : ℝ) * ((1179758795249/163840000000000 : ℝ) + 7 / 10 ^ 7 + 12 / 10 ^ 8 + epsOm)
      + (93/8 : ℝ) * ((91662067569/163840000000000 : ℝ) + 7 / 10 ^ 7 + 12 / 10 ^ 8 + epsOm)
      ≤ 501620719563395361403269/512000000000000000000000 := by
  nlinarith [hEps]

end

